Dear <%= @user.name %>,

Welcome to Memverse! Your account has been created successfully and you're moments away from starting your online memorization program.
		
Your login email is: <%= @user.email %>
		
To get started, please check your email for a confirmation link to activate your account. Once activated, we recommend:

* Complete your profile
* Set your email preferences to control how often we contact you  
* Add your first five or six verses that you would like to memorize
		
Don't forget to add 'admin@memverse.com' to your address book to ensure that any reminder emails we send don't end up in your junk mail folder. If you prefer not to receive reminder emails, just set the reminder frequency to 'Never' in your profile.

You can also try one of our mobile applications:
* Apple iOS: https://itunes.apple.com/us/app/memverse/id1014752213
* Windows Phone: https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/store/apps/memverse/9nblgggzh6nm
		
Blessings,
		
The Memverse Team
